'''End Stone''' is a {{Common}} block that can be found in {{Zone|The End}}.

== Collection ==
Collecting end stones increases the player's '''End Stone''' [[Collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of end stones.
{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|End Stone}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Mining ===
'''End Stone''' can be obtained by mining in [[The End]]. When this block is mined in The End without {{Item|Stonk}}, it has a small chance to spawn an {{MobSprite|Endermite}}.

